memory/scripts/t2_adamem.py is an EDA-domain port of the upstream HIGH
step-retrieval and transient strategy/refinement procedure. It uses the shared
metered R2G gateway and CPU embedding broker instead of the upstream model and
environment stack. It does not include Step-MFT, and is not an exact
reproduction of the upstream experimental setting. The upstream SDK, datasets,
model weights and source checkout are not included in this publication.

